and deliver more food

00:14:12.384 --> 00:14:14.686 line:0%
to meet the increased need
in New York City.

00:14:14.686 --> 00:14:17.923 line:0%
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the "donate" button.

00:14:17.923 --> 00:14:20.659 line:0%
Stay safe. Wash your hands.
We love you.

